Subject: [PATCH 39/40] arm64: dts: rockchip: give RK3588 RGA2 ownership to multi_rga

Switch RGA2 to the multi_rga driver's core-specific compatible. The node has
one owner and can return to mainline rockchip-rga by reverting this patch
together with the RGA3 ownership patch.

Reference: armbian/linux-rockchip@fd9f82366e235b8afbdf516765210e97d24dce93:arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588s.dtsi

Patches a file mainline already carries. The payload below is carried byte-for-byte from integration/0021-arm64-dts-rk3588-rga2-vendor-compat.patch; scripts/build-series.py adds the mail header and nothing else, and scripts/verify-series-parity.py proves that independently.


